-- ABOVE
-- VERSION 11.1.0
-- place 124357835578554 (game.Name reports "Ugc" - match by place id, never by name)
--
-- Berry farmer for ABOVE. TWO toggles, plus a berries/sec overlay.
--
--   Rail Cart Berry Farm  - runs while you are SEATED IN THE CART.
--   Conveyor Berry Farm   - runs while you have been STANDING ON A CONVEYOR for
--                           3 seconds, and stops the moment you leave it.
--
-- Either gate turns the same farm on. Both harvest every ripe berry bush within
-- 17 studs and pick up any loose berries. No teleport, no CFrame write, no key
-- press. Stop = switch the toggle off.
--
-- OVERLAY (v11.1.0 fix): it counts HARVESTS, not pickups. Measured: after 1122
-- verified harvests, <island>.Items still held only Coal/IronIngot/Stone/Wood
-- and ZERO Berries - RequestHarvest does not drop loose berries, the yield goes
-- to server-side inventory. A pickup-based counter therefore sat at 0.0 forever
-- and looked broken. The big number is now verified harvests/sec over a rolling
-- 5 s window; loose pickups are still counted separately in the sub line.
-- The overlay is also built at load instead of behind the menu wait, and
-- re-asserts Visible on every refresh.
--
-- Fire gap (v11.1.0 fix), all measured:
--   * 0.05 s -> 95% land, 19 harvests/s.
--   * 0.02 s -> 87% land, ~43 harvests/s.  <-- BEST, used here.
--   * 0.01 s -> 14.4% land (user's live log: 1122 harvested / 7790 fires).
--     The drop is NOT linear; it falls off a cliff below 0.02. Never go below it.
--   * 20 fires in a single frame -> 38% (server processes ~7-8 per frame).
--
-- Seated check: IronRailcart has no Seat/VehicleSeat. Boarding (its HB's
-- ProximityPrompt) sets cart attribute Rider = <your UserId>. Humanoid.Sit and
-- Humanoid.SeatPart read nil, no SeatWeld appears, char.Parent stays Workspace,
-- and distance to the cart is useless (1.4 studs while merely standing beside it).
--
-- Conveyor check (measured): a conveyor is a plain Part named "Conveyor" (264)
-- plus "ConveyorCorner" (4) and "ConveyorCornerLeft" (8), each 3.0 x 0.7 x 3.0 -
-- exactly one 3-stud grid cell - with MachineId = "Conveyor", top face at
-- y + 0.35. There is no raycast in this VM (workspace:Raycast is an inert stub),
-- so standing on one is a geometry test against cached position + half extents.
--
-- Island identity: leaving and returning creates a NEW Nodes folder under the
-- SAME island name, so the cache is keyed on Nodes.Address (measured
-- 1459067867248) and a change triggers a full rebuild.
--
-- Six loops: menu, overlay, harvest, pickup, toggle poller, overlay builder.

